##### send 'x' at +23.2 s
Powered down: DAC at zero scale, bus open, HV_EN low.
+36V_SW takes about 700 ms to bleed down.
The DAC lost VDD, so its GAIN is back to a 5.0 V full
scale. Data writes are blocked again until 'b'.

